     1	"""Who writes a store, and how it is copied (docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/live-service/OPERATING-CONTRACT.md, row 7 and "Who
     2	writes, and copies: slice 4b"): the lock's aliases, the path checks, the lock folder, preflight's locked copy and the snapshot entry
     3	point (`scripts/snapshot_store.py`), on a copy of the sealed run's real store put in WAL mode. The writer's side is proven in
     4	`clean-arch/step4-2026-11-10/stage_b/test_writer_lock.py`."""
